{"4312890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DeadEye: A Roguelike Shooter", "steam_appid": 4312890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DeadEye</strong> is a frenetic 2D pixel-art roguelike shooter set in a world consumed by pacts and secrets. You play as <strong>Douglas</strong> or <strong>Blood Samurai</strong>, heroes bound to the mysterious <strong>DeadEye</strong> pact—an ability that stops time and allows you to chain lethal actions in an instant. You must make the most of every second to survive hordes of monsters, complete missions, defeat ruthless bosses—including <strong>Lorian</strong>, a powerful lich who guards the cursed cemetery—and uncover the truth behind DeadEye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/ba29a405575ee024f0b2964dd1c3f2aa.avif?t=1787264259\" width=261 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Control time:</strong> activate DeadEye to freeze the battlefield for a few seconds; plan your shots, reloads, and movements before unleashing a storm of action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/825463c56262197b99daf20b5ee30f35.poster.avif?t=1787264259\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/825463c56262197b99daf20b5ee30f35.webm?t=1787264259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/825463c56262197b99daf20b5ee30f35.mp4?t=1787264259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Revolver and combos:</strong> wield a six-shot revolver; firing and reloading with precision maintains your combos, which multiply damage, experience, and gold. Breaking a combo slows your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/439a78197259c01c13997e63e025c495.poster.avif?t=1787264259\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/439a78197259c01c13997e63e025c495.webm?t=1787264259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/439a78197259c01c13997e63e025c495.mp4?t=1787264259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Waves and dynamic missions:</strong> face endless hordes with optional missions that appear during each run. Complete objectives to earn rewards and confront increasingly challenging bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/be8bfa5e875b4642488f082d25ed41fb.poster.avif?t=1787264259\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/be8bfa5e875b4642488f082d25ed41fb.webm?t=1787264259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/be8bfa5e875b4642488f082d25ed41fb.mp4?t=1787264259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>93 artifacts and upgrades:</strong> unlock and combine 93 artifacts of varying rarities, including cursed artifacts that grant powerful benefits at a cost. Choose from 11 traits (critical hits, pact upgrades, status effects, bullet effects…) to customize your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/0f3c782f83fff4f10d2387a5a05baf1d.poster.avif?t=1787264259\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/0f3c782f83fff4f10d2387a5a05baf1d.webm?t=1787264259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/0f3c782f83fff4f10d2387a5a05baf1d.mp4?t=1787264259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Pact system:</strong> choose from 6 pacts and evolve each one into offensive, defensive, versatile, or neutral versions; every decision can radically change your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/5c375cec5b779964b869884a6885ee7b.poster.avif?t=1787264259\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/5c375cec5b779964b869884a6885ee7b.webm?t=1787264259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312890/extras/5c375cec5b779964b869884a6885ee7b.mp4?t=1787264259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Characters and pets:</strong> play as Douglas or Blood Samurai and enhance your progression with unique pets that can equip runes. The higher 